    "prompt": "The **boxcar function** is defined by\n$$f(x)=\\begin{cases}1,&a\\le x\\le b,\\\\0,&\\text{otherwise}.\\end{cases}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
